{"id":"vd-a2-grandmas-secret-recipe","level":"a2","n":4,"title":{"en":"First, Mix the Butter and Sugar","vi":"Đầu tiên, trộn bơ với đường"},"summary":"Có lọ nước chanh bí mật trong tay, Elena đọc lại từng bước làm bánh mận cho Mateo — lần này không được quên chiếc lò.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-a2-grandmas-secret-recipe","level":"a2","title":{"en":"Grandma's Secret Recipe","vi":"Công thức bí mật của bà"}},"scene":{"background":"kitchen","props":[{"id":"cake","x":820}]},"cast":{"elena":{"name":{"en":"Elena","vi":"Elena"},"look":"teengirl","x":500,"style":{"hair":"long","hairColor":"#3A2A22","skin":"#E9B896","skinShade":"#D49E7A","outfit":"apron","top":"#8C7BC2","topShade":"#7666AD"}},"mateo":{"name":{"en":"Mateo","vi":"Mateo"},"look":"boy","x":1130,"style":{"hair":"short","hairColor":"#3A2A22","skin":"#E9B896","skinShade":"#D49E7A","top":"#5DBB63","topShade":"#4AA350","collar":"#4AA350"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"mateo","en":"OK, we have the lemon juice. What do we do first?","vi":"Rồi, có nước chanh rồi. Mình làm gì trước hả chị?","ipa":["oʊˈkeɪ","wi","hæv","ðə","ˈlɛmən","dʒus","wʌt","du","wi","du","fɝst"],"start":0.554,"end":5.184,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,1.29],[2,1.453],[3,1.752],[4,1.888],[5,2.323],[6,3.808],[7,4.08],[8,4.188],[9,4.351],[10,4.582]]},{"speaker":"elena","en":"First, mix the butter and the sugar.","vi":"Đầu tiên, trộn bơ với đường.","ipa":["fɝst","mɪks","ðə","ˈbʌtɚ","ənd","ðə","ˈʃʊɡɚ"],"start":5.974,"end":8.014,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,5.974],[1,6.425],[2,6.751],[3,6.873],[4,7.24],[5,7.349],[6,7.444]]},{"speaker":"mateo","en":"How long?","vi":"Trộn bao lâu ạ?","ipa":["haʊ","lɔŋ"],"start":8.804,"end":9.444,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,8.804],[1,9]]},{"speaker":"elena","en":"Until it's soft and pale. Grandma always said that.","vi":"Cho đến khi nó mềm và chuyển màu nhạt. Bà lúc nào cũng dặn thế.","ipa":["ənˈtɪl","ɪts","sɑft","ənd","peɪl","ˈɡɹændmɑ","ˈɔlˌweɪz","sɛd","ðæt"],"start":10.234,"end":13.734,"gesture":"e